Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,我们分开吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.15,0:00:02.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,你回来啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.57,0:00:06.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,想好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:08.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:12.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,先放这儿吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:18.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,那天，我四十九岁。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.57,0:00:23.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,结婚二十七年。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:26.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,老房子的钥匙，我一直留着。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:29.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,我自己的积蓄，一共八万六。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.20,0:00:49.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,工作还没着落。以后怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.79,0:00:55.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,也许我的人生，不是结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:00:58.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,是刚刚开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:23.17,Title,,0,0,0,,第二天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.55,0:00:33.15,Title,,0,0,0,,手续办妥后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.71,0:00:28.61,Note,,0,0,0,,个人积蓄 86,000元
